#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`alif` --- Alif Ensemble SoC functions"
msgstr ":mod:`alif` --- funkcije Alif Ensemble SoC-a"

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:7
msgid ""
"The ``alif`` module exposes port-specific functionality for the Alif "
"Ensemble SoC, including a block-device wrapper for the on-board OSPI flash "
"and a helper to dump SoC information from the Secure Enclave services."
msgstr ""
"Modul ``alif`` izlaže funkcionalnost specifičnu za priključak za Alif "
"Ensemble SoC, uključujući omotač blok-uređaja za ugrađenu OSPI flash "
"memoriju i pomoćnu funkciju za ispis informacija o SoC-u iz usluga Secure "
"Enclave."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:11
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Primjer::"

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:19
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Funkcije"

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:23
msgid ""
"Dumps device information collected from the Alif Secure Enclave services (SE"
" services) to the serial terminal."
msgstr ""
"Ispisuje informacije o uređaju prikupljene iz usluga Alif Secure Enclave (SE"
" usluge) na serijski terminal."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:27
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Klase"

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:31
msgid ""
"Creates a block-device object backed by the on-board OSPI flash. This class "
"is only available when the firmware is built with OSPI support enabled."
msgstr ""
"Stvara objekt blok-uređaja podržan ugrađenom OSPI flash memorijom. Ova klasa"
" dostupna je samo kada je ugrađeni program izgrađen s omogućenom OSPI "
"podrškom."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:35
msgid ""
"When called with no arguments, returns the default singleton object covering"
" the writable filesystem region of flash."
msgstr ""
"Kada se pozove bez argumenata, vraća zadani singleton objekt koji pokriva "
"zapisivo područje datotečnog sustava u flash memoriji."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:38
msgid ""
"``start`` is the byte offset into the flash storage region. Must be a "
"multiple of the flash block size and within the flash storage range. "
"Defaults to ``-1`` which means start at offset ``0``."
msgstr ""
"``start`` je bajtni odmak unutar područja flash pohrane. Mora biti "
"višekratnik veličine flash bloka i unutar raspona flash pohrane. Zadana "
"vrijednost je ``-1`` što znači početak na odmaku ``0``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:42
msgid ""
"``len`` is the length in bytes of the flash region exposed by the object. "
"Must be a multiple of the flash block size and not extend past the end of "
"the flash storage region. Defaults to ``-1`` which means use all remaining "
"bytes from ``start``."
msgstr ""
"``len`` je duljina u bajtovima flash područja koje objekt izlaže. Mora biti "
"višekratnik veličine flash bloka i ne smije se protezati preko kraja "
"područja flash pohrane. Zadana vrijednost je ``-1`` što znači korištenje "
"svih preostalih bajtova počevši od ``start``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:47
msgid ""
"The object also implements the buffer protocol, allowing read-only memory-"
"mapped access to the flash region via the OSPI XIP base. This makes a zero-"
"copy view of the entire region available without issuing any flash reads::"
msgstr ""
"Objekt također implementira protokol međuspremnika, omogućujući pristup "
"flash području mapiran u memoriju samo za čitanje putem OSPI XIP baze. Time "
"se dostupnim čini prikaz cijelog područja bez kopiranja, bez izvođenja "
"ikakvih flash čitanja::"

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:59
msgid ""
"Read bytes from the flash into ``buf``. Two overloads expose the simple and "
"extended interfaces:"
msgstr ""
"Čita bajtove iz flash memorije u ``buf``\\ . Dva preopterećenja izlažu "
"jednostavno i prošireno sučelje:"

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:62
msgid ""
"**Simple form** (``readblocks(block_num, buf)``): reads whole blocks "
"starting at block index ``block_num``. ``len(buf)`` must be a multiple of "
"the flash block size."
msgstr ""
"**Jednostavni oblik** (\\ ``readblocks(block_num, buf)``\\ ): čita cijele "
"blokove počevši od indeksa bloka ``block_num``\\ . ``len(buf)`` mora biti "
"višekratnik veličine flash bloka."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:66
msgid ""
"**Extended form** (``readblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``): reads "
"``len(buf)`` bytes -- not necessarily a whole number of blocks -- starting "
"at byte ``offset`` within block ``block_num``. ``len(buf)`` has no alignment"
" constraint."
msgstr ""
"**Prošireni oblik** (\\ ``readblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``\\ ): čita "
"``len(buf)`` bajtova -- ne nužno cijeli broj blokova -- počevši od bajta "
"``offset`` unutar bloka ``block_num``\\ . ``len(buf)`` nema ograničenje "
"poravnanja."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:71
msgid ""
"Returns ``0`` on success or a negative error code. Note that the standard "
"MicroPython block-device protocol returns ``None``; the ``alif`` driver "
"intentionally exposes the underlying OSPI status code so callers that bypass"
" :mod:`vfs` can react to hardware errors."
msgstr ""
"Vraća ``0`` u slučaju uspjeha ili negativni kod pogreške. Imajte na umu da "
"standardni MicroPython protokol blok-uređaja vraća ``None``\\ ; upravljački "
"program ``alif`` namjerno izlaže pripadajući OSPI statusni kod kako bi "
"pozivatelji koji zaobilaze :mod:`vfs` mogli reagirati na hardverske "
"pogreške."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:80
msgid ""
"Write bytes from ``buf`` to the flash. Two overloads expose the simple and "
"extended interfaces:"
msgstr ""
"Zapisuje bajtove iz ``buf`` u flash memoriju. Dva preopterećenja izlažu "
"jednostavno i prošireno sučelje:"

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:83
msgid ""
"**Simple form** (``writeblocks(block_num, buf)``): writes whole blocks "
"starting at block index ``block_num``. ``len(buf)`` must be a multiple of "
"the flash block size. Each affected block is erased automatically before "
"being written."
msgstr ""
"**Jednostavni oblik** (\\ ``writeblocks(block_num, buf)``\\ ): zapisuje "
"cijele blokove počevši od indeksa bloka ``block_num``\\ . ``len(buf)`` mora "
"biti višekratnik veličine flash bloka. Svaki zahvaćeni blok automatski se "
"briše prije zapisivanja."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:88
msgid ""
"**Extended form** (``writeblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``): writes "
"``len(buf)`` bytes -- not necessarily a whole number of blocks -- starting "
"at byte ``offset`` within block ``block_num``. ``len(buf)`` has no alignment"
" constraint, and **no implicit erase is performed** -- the caller must "
"ensure the affected blocks have been erased via a prior :meth:`ioctl(6, "
"block_num) <ioctl>` call."
msgstr ""
"**Prošireni oblik** (\\ ``writeblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``\\ ): "
"zapisuje ``len(buf)`` bajtova -- ne nužno cijeli broj blokova -- počevši od "
"bajta ``offset`` unutar bloka ``block_num``\\ . ``len(buf)`` nema "
"ograničenje poravnanja i **ne izvodi se implicitno brisanje** -- pozivatelj "
"mora osigurati da su zahvaćeni blokovi izbrisani prethodnim pozivom "
":meth:`ioctl(6, block_num) <ioctl>`\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:95
msgid ""
"Returns ``0`` on success or a negative error code (see :meth:`readblocks` "
"for the rationale)."
msgstr ""
"Vraća ``0`` u slučaju uspjeha ili negativni kod pogreške (obrazloženje vidi "
"u :meth:`readblocks`\\ )."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:100
msgid ""
"Performs a block-device control operation. ``cmd`` is one of the standard "
"MicroPython ``MP_BLOCKDEV_IOCTL_*`` commands:"
msgstr ""
"Izvodi upravljačku operaciju blok-uređaja. ``cmd`` je jedna od standardnih "
"MicroPython ``MP_BLOCKDEV_IOCTL_*`` naredbi:"

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:103
msgid "``1`` (init) --- returns ``0``."
msgstr "``1`` (init) --- vraća ``0``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:104
msgid "``2`` (deinit) --- returns ``0``."
msgstr "``2`` (deinit) --- vraća ``0``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:105
msgid "``3`` (sync) --- returns ``0``."
msgstr "``3`` (sync) --- vraća ``0``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:106
msgid "``4`` (block count) --- returns the number of blocks in the region."
msgstr "``4`` (broj blokova) --- vraća broj blokova u području."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:108
msgid "``5`` (block size) --- returns the flash block size in bytes."
msgstr "``5`` (veličina bloka) --- vraća veličinu flash bloka u bajtovima."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:109
msgid ""
"``6`` (block erase) --- erases the block at index ``arg`` and returns the "
"result of the erase operation."
msgstr ""
"``6`` (brisanje bloka) --- briše blok na indeksu ``arg`` i vraća rezultat "
"operacije brisanja."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:112
msgid "Other ``cmd`` values return ``None``."
msgstr "Ostale vrijednosti ``cmd`` vraćaju ``None``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:115
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "Konstante"

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:120
msgid ""
"Present and set to ``True`` only when the firmware is built with USB Mass "
"Storage Class support enabled. The attribute is absent otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Prisutno i postavljeno na ``True`` samo kada je ugrađeni program izgrađen s "
"omogućenom podrškom za USB Mass Storage Class. Inače atribut nije prisutan."
